    p.Article-Paragraph.
      Returns #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID true] #[+Keyphrase--YDID if and only if] the #[+Term--YDID parameter's]
        #[+Term__Contrast--YDID value] is an #[+Keyword--YDID empty] #[+Term--YDID string], otherwise returns
        #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID false].

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      Nothing notable, but this #[+Term--YDID function] may be demanded for the development of other
        #[+ImportantEntity--YDID Stylus] #[+Term--YDID functions] and #[+Term--YDID mixins].
      This #[+Term--YDID function] has been used even for the implementation of
        #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID isDimensionlessQuantity], another value type checking #[+Term--YDID function]:

    +CodeViewer--YDF
