    //- ┅┅┅ Nullables ┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅┅
    +Heading--YDF({
      level: 2,
      innerHTML: localizedSectioning.nullables.$heading,
      HTML_ID: localizedSectioning.nullables.$anchor
    }).Article-Heading3

    p.Article-Paragraph.
      The nullability has the shortcomings in #[+ImportantEntity--YDID Stylus].
      This #[+Term--YDID functions] group gives the higher safety level when working with potentially
        #[+Term--YDID null values].
      For more specific information, see the theoretical reference below.


    //- ╍╍╍ Theoretical Minimum: Nullability in Stylus ╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍
