    p.Article-Paragraph.
      The anomalies are starting here.
      Although #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID sample3 == null] is #[+Keyword--YDID falsy], the
        #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID typeof(sample3) == "null"] is #[+Keyword--YDID truthy]:

