    p.Article-Paragraph.
      Returns #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID true] for any values of #[+Term--YDID parameter]
        #[+Keyword--YDID except] #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID null], thus returns
        #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID false] #[+Keyphrase--YDID if and only if] the value of #[+Term--YDID parameter]
        is #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID null].
      It is&nbsp;#[+Keyword--YDID not]&nbsp;the equivalent ot #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID x != null], because
        at it has been shown above the direct comparison with  #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID null]
        #[+Keyword--YDID not]&nbsp;always works as expected.

    //- ╍╍╍ `isNull`╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍╍
