        is a #[+Term--YDID Stylus literal] (satisfies to #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID typeof(value) == "literal"]),
        herewith starts from #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID calc(], otherwise returns #[+ImportantEntity__Code--YDID false].
      Although there is&nbsp;no specific data type for #[+Term--YDID calc expressions] it is possible to analyze
        does the literal represents the #[+Term--YDID calc expression] or no, it is what this #[+Term--YDID function]
        does.


